  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing biosecurity and biology for peaceful purposes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The planned effect on society (Impact) is: 
Enhanced capacity of laboratories from the beneficiary developing countries to harness and leverage the benefits of biological sciences and technology for peaceful purposes and biosecurity, in accordance with Articles III and X of the BWC.

The planned effects for the target group of the Project (Outcome) are:
Enhanced skills, knowledge, and awareness of experts from beneficiary countries on peaceful uses of biology and biosecurity.

The main planned outputs of the Project (Outputs) are:
&#x2022;	Knowledge and skills in biological science for peaceful purposes and biosecurity enhanced.
&#x2022;	Scientific and technological information exchange for the use of bacteriological (biological) agents and toxins for peaceful purposes promoted.
&#x2022;	Information and project knowledge management promoted.</narrative>
  </description>
